      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S A TANGO (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.81) at Gunnedah behind Armatree Diesel in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Makes plenty of appeal. OXLEY FLYER (3) was in the placings last time but three back posted a head turning 17.29 win over 300m at Taree Super Track. Top win three back and rates a key player again. SERENA BEACH (2) is having her first look at this track. In the money last start when third (20.27) at Gunnedah over 340m. Will give a great sight again. POURING RAIN (8) can feature with the right run.",
